# The ruling: the token trigger works only if Preacher attacks a player (CR 508.1m, 506.2 - attacking a planeswalker is
# not attacking its controller). Bot2 has the most life (20 to Bot1's 10), but Preacher attacks Bot2's Liliana of the Veil
# instead, so no Vampire is made; and Bot1 does not have the most life, so there is no draw either. Liliana takes the
# Preacher's 2 damage (3 loyalty -> 1). Compare the attack on the player at the same life totals in
# preacher-of-the-schism-attacking-the-player-with-the-most-life-only-makes-a-vampire.

